 },
 "blocks": [
  {
   "style": "title",
   "inlines": [
    {
     "text": "kspage"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "style": "subtitle",
   "inlines": [
    {
     "text": "The manual — an editing system for writing prose, tables and slides all in one document"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "style": "body",
   "inlines": [
    {
     "text": "This manual is "
    },
    {
     "text": "written in kspage itself. "
    },
    {
     "text": "You may type over it where you stand as you read, to see for yourself. Shut the window and open it afresh and it comes back."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "style": "hint",
   "inlines": [
    {
     "text": "In a hurry, the chapters “The basics of typing” and “Keyboard shortcuts” are enough on their own. Come back to the tables and the slides once you need them."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "style": "subheading",
   "inlines": [
    {
     "text": "Contents"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "style": "contents"
  },
  {
   "style": "chapter",
   "inlines": [
    {
     "text": "Where this begins"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "style": "body",
   "inlines": [
    {
     "text": "kspage is an editing system for writing prose, tables and slides "
    },
    {
     "text": "as one document",
     "style": "strong"
    },
    {
     "text": ". The three are not separate tools; the same tree is only laid out differently."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "style": "table",
   "children": [
    {
     "style": "",
     "children": [
      {
       "style": "heading-cell",
       "inlines": [
        {
         "text": "The look"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "style": "heading-cell",
       "inlines": [
        {
         "text": "The laying"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "style": "heading-cell",
       "inlines": [
        {
         "text": "What it is for"
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "style": "",
     "children": [
      {
       "style": "cell",
       "inlines": [
        {
         "text": "Prose"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "style": "cell",
       "inlines": [
        {
         "text": "Flowed in"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "style": "cell",
       "inlines": [
        {
         "text": "Reports, design papers, letters"
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "style": "",
     "children": [
      {
       "style": "cell",
       "inlines": [
        {
         "text": "Table"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "style": "cell",
       "inlines": [
        {
         "text": "Grid"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "style": "cell",
       "inlines": [
        {
         "text": "Quotations, totals, listings"
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "style": "",
     "children": [
      {
       "style": "cell",
       "inlines": [
        {
         "text": "Slide"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "style": "cell",
       "inlines": [
        {
         "text": "Absolute coordinates"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "style": "cell",
       "inlines": [
        {
         "text": "Slides that explain, diagrams"
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "style": "section",
   "inlines": [
    {
     "text": "Opening it"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "style": "body",
   "inlines": [
    {
     "text": "What comes out is one HTML file. "
    },
    {
     "text": "Double-clicking it to open is all there is to it.",
     "style": "strong"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "style": "bullet",
   "inlines": [
    {
     "text": "No web server is wanted (the wasm and the JS are both inside that one file)."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "style": "bullet",
   "inlines": [
    {
     "text": "Nothing has to be installed either. The browser you already use will do."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "style": "bullet",
   "inlines": [
    {
     "text": "Copy that one file to another machine and it opens there the same way."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "style": "section",
   "inlines": [
    {
     "text": "How the screen reads"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "style": "body",
   "inlines": [
    {
     "text": "The screen parts into five."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "style": "table",
   "children": [
    {
     "style": "",
     "children": [
      {
       "style": "heading-cell",
       "inlines": [
        {
         "text": "Name"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "style": "heading-cell",
       "inlines": [
        {
         "text": "Where"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "style": "heading-cell",
       "inlines": [
        {
         "text": "What is there"
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "style": "",
     "children": [
      {
       "style": "cell",
       "inlines": [
        {
         "text": "The menu bar"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "style": "cell",
       "inlines": [
        {
         "text": "At the very top"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "style": "cell",
       "inlines": [
        {
         "text": "File, Style, Table, Insert, Share, Review. A press opens one"
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "style": "",
     "children": [
      {
       "style": "cell",
       "inlines": [
        {
         "text": "The ribbon"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "style": "cell",
       "inlines": [
        {
         "text": "Below it"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "style": "cell",
       "inlines": [
        {
         "text": "The commands used most are listed"
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "style": "",
     "children": [
      {
       "style": "cell",
       "inlines": [
        {
         "text": "The editing area"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "style": "cell",
       "inlines": [
        {
         "text": "In the middle"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "style": "cell",
       "inlines": [
        {
         "text": "The document itself. Press here and type"
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "style": "",
     "children": [
      {
       "style": "cell",
       "inlines": [
        {
         "text": "Navigation"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "style": "cell",
       "inlines": [
        {
         "text": "On the right"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "style": "cell",
       "inlines": [
        {
         "text": "Splits into the 3 tabs Headings, Slides and Placed. Press one to move there"
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "style": "",
     "children": [
      {
       "style": "cell",
       "inlines": [
        {
         "text": "The status bar"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "style": "cell",
       "inlines": [
        {
         "text": "At the very bottom"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "style": "cell",
       "inlines": [
        {
         "text": "Where you are, what a press did, how many pages there are"
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "style": "body",
   "inlines": [
    {
     "text": "The navigation on the right is put out and folded with the "
    },
    {
     "text": "Navigation",
     "style": "key"
    },
    {
     "text": " to the menu bar's right. The "
    },
    {
     "text": "✕",
     "style": "key"
    },
    {
     "text": " inside the panel folds it too."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "style": "bullet",
   "inlines": [
    {
     "text": "Headings — the whole document's headings and contents. A press moves there."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "style": "bullet",
   "inlines": [
    {
     "text": "Slides — the slides inside the document. A press moves to that slide."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "style": "bullet",
   "inlines": [
    {
     "text": "Placed — the shapes and images laid on the slide or the cell you are in. A press selects one. What is nearest the front is listed on top."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "style": "hint",
   "inlines": [
    {
     "text": "To the right of a tab's name is how many are inside it. Without opening it you can read “there are three things placed”."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "style": "warning",
   "inlines": [
    {
     "text": "Only the one tab you chose comes out. The tab chosen is remembered, so the same one comes out the next time you open it."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "style": "body",
   "inlines": [
    {
     "text": "The panel's width can be changed. Bring the mouse to the seam between the panel and the body and the arrow changes; drag it left or right from there. Widen it when a long heading is cut off and cannot be read. The width you changed is remembered, so it is the same width the next time you open it."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "style": "bullet",
   "inlines": [
    {
     "text": "Pressing the seam and typing ← → changes the width too (16 dots a press). This is the way when holding the thin seam down with the mouse is hard."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "style": "bullet",
   "inlines": [
    {
     "text": "Press the seam twice and it returns to the width it was."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "style": "warning",
   "inlines": [
    {
     "text": "It widens as far as half the window and no further, because once the body is narrower than the panel the navigation eats the part you are reading."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "style": "hint",
   "inlines": [
    {
     "text": "While you are editing, a region of prose, a table and a slide are each fenced in a grey dotted line. That dotted line comes out neither in printing nor in the HTML written out."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "style": "body",
   "inlines": [
    {
     "text": "Over the body, a "
    },
    {
     "text": "right-click",
     "style": "strong"
    },
    {
     "text": " opens a menu that acts where you are. Comment, Link, Footnote and Style are listed, and inside a table's cell putting rows and columns in and out is listed too."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "style": "warning",
   "inlines": [
    {
     "text": "Over a menu or a tool the browser's own menu comes out as it is. Cut, copy and paste are done by key (Ctrl+X / Ctrl+C / Ctrl+V)."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "style": "body",
   "inlines": [
    {
     "text": "To look at it larger, use "
    },
    {
     "text": "the browser's zoom",
     "style": "strong"
    },
    {
     "text": " ("
    },
    {
     "text": "Ctrl",
     "style": "key"
    },
    {
     "text": " and "
    },
    {
     "text": "+",
     "style": "key"
    },
    {
     "text": " / "
    },
    {
     "text": "−",
     "style": "key"
    },
    {
     "text": "). The menus grow with it."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "style": "warning",
   "inlines": [
    {
     "text": "Zooming changes nothing in the document. What is copied to paper does not move, so what is printed is the same."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "style": "slide",
   "children": [
    {
     "style": "screen-bar",
     "frame": {
